{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "s4-auto-irrigation",
    "name": "S4 - Irigasi Otomatis (ML → RabbitMQ → MQTT)",
    "description": "Skenario 4: Alur irigasi otomatis yang dipicu deteksi tanah kering oleh ML, command dikirim via RabbitMQ, dan Node-RED meneruskan ke MQTT\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT: Ini adalah ASYNC NON-BLOCKING flow:\n1. Step 4.2: Kirim perintah START → langsung return 'command_queued' (tidak tunggu proses selesai)\n2. Background: async-publisher.php membaca queue dan publish ke RabbitMQ setiap 1 detik\n3. Background: Node-RED consumer membaca dari RabbitMQ dan kontrol MQTT valve\n4. Baru setelah itu: Log irigasi ter-create di database\n\nJadi antara Step 4.2 dan Step 4.7 ada DELAY 1-3 detik. Ini adalah expected behavior untuk API responsiveness yang cepat.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "4.0 - Get Access Token (Petugas)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.environment.set('access_token', jsonData.access_token);",
              "  console.log('✓ Access Token (petugas) saved');",
              "  console.log('Role: petugas - dapat mengontrol irigasi');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "officer@agri.com"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "farmer123"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "web-app"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "web_secret_123"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:3002/oauth/token",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "3002",
          "path": ["oauth", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Dapatkan access token sebagai petugas (officer@agri.com)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.1 - Verifikasi Skenario Tanah Kering via ML",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"soil_moisture\": 18,\n  \"air_temp\": 35,\n  \"rain_forecast\": 0,\n  \"growth_phase\": \"generatif\",\n  \"evapotranspiration\": 7.0\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/predict/irrigation",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["predict", "irrigation"]
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi ML mendeteksi tanah sangat kering (expected: irrigation_urgency = Kritis)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.2 - Kirim Perintah Irigasi START",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  console.log('✓ Irrigation START command accepted');",
              "  console.log('Status:', pm.response.code);",
              "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "  console.log('Zone:', jsonData.data.zone_id);",
              "  console.log('Command:', jsonData.data.message);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"zone_id\": 2,\n  \"action\": \"start\",\n  \"trigger_type\": \"manual\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8002/irrigation/command",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8002",
          "path": ["irrigation", "command"]
        },
        "description": "Kirim perintah START irigasi zona 2 (Direct service, bypasses gateway)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.2.5 - ⏳ WAIT 2 Detik (Async Processing)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "console.log('⏳ Tunggu async publisher & consumer memproses...');",
              "console.log('   1. async-publisher.php membaca queue (max 1 detik)');",
              "   2. Node-RED consumer membaca dari RabbitMQ dan kontrol valve (max 1 detik)');",
              "console.log('   Total delay: ~2-3 detik');",
              "pm.test('wait', function() {});",
              "// PostMan tidak support sleep, jalankan step ini aja untuk delay"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:3000/api/irrigation/status",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "3000",
          "path": ["api", "irrigation", "status"]
        },
        "description": "Endpoint ini hanya untuk dokumentasi. MANUAL WAIT 2-3 detik sebelum step 4.3 agar async processing selesai.\n\nFLOW PENJELASAN:\n• Step 4.2 publish perintah START ke queue file: /queue/msg_*.json\n• async-publisher.php (background) membaca setiap 1 detik → publish ke RabbitMQ\n• Node-RED consumer (background) membaca dari iot.valve → kontrol MQTT valve\n• Baru setelah valve diaktifkan: irrigation log ter-create di database\n\nAnda PERLU MANUAL WAIT 2-3 detik atau gunakan Postman delay jika tersedia."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.3 - Verifikasi Log Irigasi di Database",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8080",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8080"
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi phpMyAdmin (http://localhost:8080): agriCity → irr_irrigation_logs. \n\n⏱️ CATATAN: Log baru muncul SETELAH step 4.2 + delay ~2-3 detik karena async flow. Trigger_type bisa 'manual' atau 'otomatis_ml' tergantung source perintah."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.4 - Cek RabbitMQ Queue iot.valve",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Basic Z3Vlc3Q6Z3Vlc3Q="
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:15672/api/queues/%2F/iot.valve",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "15672",
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "iot.valve"]
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi queue iot.valve di RabbitMQ (login: guest/guest)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.5 - Verifikasi Node-RED Flow 2",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:1880",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "1880"
        },
        "description": "Buka Node-RED (http://localhost:1880), lihat Flow 2 - Irrigation Valve Command (harus ada RabbitMQ subscriber dan MQTT publisher)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.6 - Kirim Perintah Irigasi STOP",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  console.log('✓ Irrigation STOP command accepted');",
              "  console.log('Irrigation command queued');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"zone_id\": 2,\n  \"action\": \"stop\",\n  \"trigger_type\": \"manual\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8002/irrigation/command",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "8002",
          "path": ["irrigation", "command"]
        },
        "description": "Hentikan irigasi zona 2 (Direct service, bypasses gateway)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.7 - Lihat Riwayat Log Irigasi",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "console.log('📋 Mengambil riwayat irigasi dari database');",
              "console.log('⏱️ Jika tidak ada log zona 2 yang baru, tunggu lebih lama atau periksa:');",
              "console.log('   1. RabbitMQ queue: http://localhost:15672 (iot.valve queue)');",
              "console.log('   2. Node-RED logs: http://localhost:1880');",
              "console.log('   3. Docker logs: docker logs agri-php-irrigation')"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "  console.log('✓ Logs retrieved successfully');",
              "  if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
              "    console.log('\\n📊 Recent logs:');",
              "    for (var i = 0; i < Math.min(3, jsonData.data.length); i++) {",
              "      var log = jsonData.data[i];",
              "      console.log((i+1) + '. Zone', log.zone_id, '- Trigger:', log.trigger_type, '- Status:', (log.ended_at ? 'COMPLETED' : 'ACTIVE'));",
              "    }",
              "  }",
              "} else {",
              "  console.log('❌ Failed to retrieve logs:', pm.response.code);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:3000/api/irrigation/logs",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "3000",
          "path": ["api", "irrigation", "logs"]
        },
        "description": "Lihat riwayat lengkap log irigasi. ⏱️ Jika log zona 2 belum muncul, itu NORMAL - tunggu 2-3 detik lagi karena async flow."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4.8 - Test Irigasi Manual START",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
